      "id": "F-1",
      "severity": "minor",
      "suggested_fix": "Cite the appointment->doctor foreign key and the non-null doctor_id, and restate the risk as: how does DELETE /api/doctors/:id behave for a doctor with Scheduled appointments.",
      "text": "REQ-13 says deleting a doctor 'may leave no name to show'. But appointment.doctor_id is NOT NULL with a foreign key to doctor, so an appointment cannot lose its doctor row silently. The delete fails, cascades or is a soft delete. The basis does not use this fact."
    },
