          "ref": "artifacts/HMS-1/run_01M5HF2TJRVWS776C5G07JE7NH/impact.md#L166"
        }
      ],
      "id": "F-2",
      "severity": "minor",
      "suggested_fix": "State whether AppointmentRepo is changed or only PatientRepo, and cite AppointmentRepo in the api module entry if it is touched.",
      "text": "C6 claims appointment rows are read through AppointmentRepo, yet the API module entry lists only PatientRepo for the next-appointment lookup. The analysis does not say whether AppointmentRepo is touched or the lookup is a join inside PatientRepo."
    }
